<title>JAPAN: Meiko Shokai plans share split.</title>
<headline>Meiko Shokai plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meiko Shokai Co Ltd said on Friday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on July 10, for shareholders as of May 20.</p>
</text>
